  "title": "Ex 4.11 · a | b and c | d give ac | bd",
  "prompt": "Use a direct proof. Let $a, b, c, d$ be integers. Show that if $a \\mid b$ and $c \\mid d$, then $ac \\mid bd$.",
  "answer_format": "A structured proof: let, case, expr and witness steps (notes optional). No final answer box.",
