  "hints": [
    "Write b in terms of a and d in terms of c, with two different new letters.",
    "Multiply: bd = (ac)·(something)."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Since $a \\mid b$ and $c \\mid d$, $b = aj$ and $d = ck$ for some integers $j, k$.",
    "$bd = (aj)(ck) = ac(jk)$, and $jk$ is an integer, so $ac \\mid bd$. $\\blacksquare$"
  ],
